          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.11.13+DEU.11.14+DEU.11.15+DEU.11.16+DEU.11.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 11.13-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Mwaaba ne murekeeresia kamalaka kano mala mwakaliinda ne khukaria, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe akhaliinde endakaano ne khumwekesia enywe busiime bwa buli lwosi, nga ne asuubisia bakuuka benywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alamusiima enywe ne khumubiita enywe chikhabi, nio amukhole mutasiikhe mube bakali mala mube ne babaana bakali. Alaana chikhabi khu mikuunda kienywe, nio mube ne bibiaamo, endali ne kamafura. Alamubiita enywe chikhabi khulwe khumuelesia chikhaafu chingali ne kamakheese. Alamueleselia enywe chikhabi chino choosi mu sibala nisio aasuubisia bakuuka benywe ali alimuelesia enywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enywe mulibiitwa chikhabi khukhila chikholo choosi. Buli omuseecha namwe omukhasi aliba no mwana. Ne chikhaafu chenywe se chikhasuune tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aakhamurusiekho bulwaale bwoosi. Bulwaale bumayaanu bwe e Misiri nibwo mwamanya se bulimwichakho tawe. Ne kakhali Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alielesia bulwaale obwo boosi babamubiila enywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mukhoya mubunie babaandu boosi nibo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe alira mu bunyali bwenywe. Mukhabakholela siisa namwe mwasaaya bawele babwe tawe, sikila lilienelio liliba kumureko khwinywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mukhaloma muli, ‘Babaandu bano bali be kamaani khu khukhila efwe, nono se khunyala khwabarusiamo tawe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhabaria tawe. Ne kakhali khebulila niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe aakholela Farao omwami owe Misiri ne khu baandu bewe boosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khebulila kamakhako kamakali niko mwabona, bimanyisio ne bibiindu bie khuukia ne kamaani ne bunyali bukali nibwo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe arumikhira khumukhola enywe mube balekhuule. Alibunia babaandu nibo muriire bano boosi, mu ngila ng'eneyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khutasa khwako, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe alabarumira nibo butinyu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7.20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "butinyu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "alibarumira nibo butinyu namwe arume bulwaale.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " khukhwola nga basiili balamu mwinywe ne babekisa balibunisibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukharia babaandu bano tawe, sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe ali ne nanywe, ali Wele omukali lundi niye babaandu baria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhaoone chikholo chino chirure ebweeni wenywe siangeekhe siangeekhe. Se mulanyala khuchibunia choosi khangu busa mu siise silala tawe, sikila mwaba ne mukhola murio chisaang'i che mundaa chilatasikha mala chibe ne kamaani lukali khwinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe akhare basiku benywe mu bunyali bwenywe mala abakoyaanie bamwiembeelele khukhwola nga ne babunisibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhare babaami babwe mu bunyali bwenywe. Mukhabeere mala balibililwa se aliio olinyala khumukhiingilila enywe tawe, mulabunia buli mundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulaambia bifwaani bie bawele babwe biye. Mukhekoomba efwesa namwe esahabu eeli khu bifwaani tawe lundi mukhabukula ebe eyenywe tawe. Mwaba ne mukhola murio, ebio bilaba kimireko khwinywe. Bibiindu ebio bisinya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhareerakho silala khu bifwaani bino mu chingo chenywe tawe, busa mukhola murio mwaba silaamo nga nibio. Bibukule khuba biibi lundi bisinya, sikila bili asi we silaamo sia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
